# art_source/ is the workshop. Track the small, meaningful artefacts; keep the
# bulk out of git.

# Donor art, copied from the owning mod or the vanilla texture dump. Not ours
# to redistribute, and regenerable in one command:
#     python Source/grab_source_art.py <key>
*/restored/

# The untouched files as they came back from the image model. Multi-megabyte,
# and preserved by fit_sprite.py so a bad fit can always be redone.
*/*/_raw/
*/restored_regenerated/

# Tracked deliberately (do not add to this file):
#   MANIFEST.json       the measurements every check reads
#   briefs/*.md, *.txt  the per-facing briefs and the prompts exactly as sent
#   */HOLES.txt         what is still missing
#   CONTACT_SHEET.png   the donor facings on one sheet
#   wrecked/*.png, kludged/*.png, icon/*.png   the fitted pictures
